---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/content';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — TenTo100"
  description="TenTo100's terms of service, including the terms of our SMS text-messaging program."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-faint">Effective date: [EFFECTIVE DATE — e.g. July 1, 2026]</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      These terms govern your use of www.tento100.com and the services of
      [LEGAL ENTITY — e.g. TenTo100, LLC] (“TenTo100”, “we”, “us”). By using the site or opting
      in to our SMS program, you agree to them.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Part A — The site</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        The site and its content are provided “as is” for general information; we may change or
        discontinue any part of it at any time. Content on the site is ours or used with
        permission — don't reproduce it without asking. Nothing on the site is professional,
        legal, or financial advice. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable
        for indirect or consequential damages arising from your use of the site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Part B — SMS program terms</h2>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. The program</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        TenTo100 sends [PROGRAM DESCRIPTION — e.g. service, scheduling, and project-update]
        text messages to people who opt in. How the program works — including the sign-up
        keyword and number — is described at
        <a class="text-accent underline" href="/messaging">tento100.com/messaging</a>.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. Opting in</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        You join by texting our number (or our keyword to that number). Before program messages
        begin you receive a one-time confirmation request; <strong>no program messages are sent
        unless you reply YES</strong>. We record your consent — the exact language, timestamp,
        and channel. Consent is not a condition of purchasing anything.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. Frequency and rates</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile
        carrier and plan. Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. Opting out and help</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to cancel; you'll receive one opt-out
        confirmation and then no further messages. Reply <strong>HELP</strong>, or email
        <a class="text-accent underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, for
        assistance. Text START to rejoin.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Your number</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        You represent that the mobile number you opt in with is yours, and you agree to notify
        us (or text STOP from the old number) if you give it up, so messages don't reach the
        number's next owner.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. Privacy</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        Our <a class="text-accent underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> governs the
        program's data. Mobile information and SMS opt-in/consent data will not be shared with
        third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes &amp; contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        We may update these terms; material changes to the SMS program terms will be announced
        by text or on this page. Continued participation after a change is acceptance. Questions:
        <a class="text-accent underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
